member.summary:
The route segment for the operator key-rotation endpoints (Phase 84.3): POST
{RoutePrefix}/keys/rotate (rotate the instance actor's signing key via the
) and POST {RoutePrefix}/keys/retire (retire a
specific key IRI). Mapped under the versioned prefix, like every other endpoint. Admin-gated: the
caller's authenticated actor IRI must be the instance actor ();
otherwise the request is refused (401 unauthenticated / 403 not the instance actor).

